{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Wealth</b> — The rich man's wealth is like a fortified city; it will save him momentarily from his trouble, even though he is not wise, and the poor, who lack understanding — their ruin will terrify it."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:52.766365515Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}